    "steps":[
      ["Shortbread","Heat the oven to 175 °C (350 °F) and line a 9×9-inch pan with parchment. Mix the shortbread ingredients, press evenly into the pan and bake about 10 minutes until the edges are lightly golden. Cool at least 10 minutes."],
      ["Caramel","Whisk the caramel ingredients in a small saucepan over medium-low heat until gently bubbling, about 2 minutes. Pour over the cooled crust and spread."],
      ["Set","Refrigerate 30–60 minutes until firm."],
      ["Chocolate","Melt the chocolate chips with the coconut oil until smooth, spread over the caramel and sprinkle with flaky salt. Refrigerate about 30 minutes until hardened."],
      ["Cut","Lift out and cut into 16 bars (or 32 minis)."]
